  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Sir_lee.jpg\" title=\"Sir Lee of York\"><img alt=\"Sir Lee of York\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"265\" src=\"/images/Sir_lee.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Sir_lee.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Sir Lee of York</div></div></div>\n<p>Sir Lee of York is the first NPC you see when you enter <a href=\"/wiki/Dew_Valley\" title=\"Dew Valley\">Dew Valley</a> and most people get their first quest from him. He has only a few normal quests and a repeatable quest.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Sir_Lee_of_York.27s_Quests\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Sir Lee of York's Quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Recruitment\" title=\"Recruitment\">Recruitment</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Slayeth_Wolves_Verily\" title=\"Slayeth Wolves Verily\">Slayeth Wolves Verily</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wolf_Pelts\" title=\"Wolf Pelts\">Wolf Pelts</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Deliver_Wolf_Pelts\" title=\"Deliver Wolf Pelts\">Deliver Wolf Pelts</a>\n</li></ul>\n<p>The repeatable quest is:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/More_Wolf_Pelts\" title=\"More Wolf Pelts\">More Wolf Pelts</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
